 him\u2014no controllers needed. Unlock outfits and enjoy bite-size mini-games that fit perfectly into short sessions.\n\n{1804321480451609}\n\n# What you\u2019ll do\n\n-  Care & bond: Feed bottles, rock to sleep, cheer him up.\n\n-  Play together: Quick, silly mini-games that make the baby giggle.\n\n- Dress-up: Mix and match adorable outfits and space-themed accessories.\n\n- Hand-tracking: Natural, intuitive interactions with your own hands.\n\n\nWholesome, relaxing, and kid-friendly. No violence or scary content\u2014just sweet moments and gentle humor.\n\nYour little one is already waiting! \ud83d\udc76\u2728\n", "short_description": "Care for a tiny space baby in mixed reality! Play games, feed him, and dress him in cute outfits. Hand-tracking controls make everything feel natural\u2014no controllers needed. Relaxing, funny, and wholesome fun."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://babyboomar.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "THEIA GAMES", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://babyboomar.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24911533498533445"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1675316316469762"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1675316316469762"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"s